{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/cnaa41","slideIndex":0,"text":"Opening: “We are Team InnoSphere. Our project is SkyGuard, a weather station integrity monitor. It analyzes a day of hourly temperature, pressure, and humidity data, flags suspicious sensor behavior, and returns smoothed readings for the current hour. I’ll walk through what we built and who it is intended to help.”"}
