{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/1r54d2","slideIndex":2,"text":"“The full path starts in the dashboard, where a user loads or edits 24 hourly readings. The browser sends them to the FastAPI service. The service combines the trained model with checks for suspicious signal patterns, then returns a status, fault type, and observed versus healed values.”"}
