{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/k3ry0g","slideIndex":8,"text":"“To demo it, start the API, open the dashboard, load sample data or search for a city, and run diagnostics. Then explain the status, fault category, reconstruction error, and observed versus healed values. SkyGuard is a prototype for making weather telemetry easier to inspect and recover.”"}